    "sticky-sgds": {"x": 4080, "y": 0, "w": 420, "text": "Styled with the Scottish Government Design System v4.3.0 stylesheet (MIT), unmodified. No Scottish Government logo or brand assets are used: the header carries a text title only.", "fill": "blue"},
    "sticky-content": {"x": 4080, "y": 2280, "w": 420, "text": "Values in [square brackets] on demonstration records are completed from cited public sources during the build. Example records are fictional and always named 'Example:'.", "fill": "teal"},
    "sticky-solutions": {"x": 4080, "y": 3100, "w": 480, "text": "Spec v1.0: a common solution is an owned offer of reuse; a codebase is code. solution.yml describes the solution and lists its codebases (each with its own publiccode.yml and maintenance type). open_data links to catalogues; datasets are not listed. csr-0001 is a service whose codebase is the register repository.", "fill": "purple"},
